and—hopefully—make it out alive.The upcoming playtest will feature new maps, monsters, and awesome new weapons!Here’s a sneak peek at two of the new maps coming to BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS:Research Lab 🔬Low Town 🌃📅 Playtest Period: To be announced🔗 How to Joi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035193","verified_at":"2026-10-23T09:04:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4867740-1847286114034867","game_id":"steam-4867740","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS Has Reached 1,000 Wishlists! 🐾","summary":"Quack, Quack! Hello, Voyagers! 🫡BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS has reached 1,000 wishlists during Steam Next Fest!A heartfelt thank you to everyone who discovered BEASTOPIA, showed us their support, and joined us in looking forward to the journey ahead. ❤️To everyone who played the demo during Next Fest, ventured into danger in search of loot, and experienced the tension of making it out alive—thank you!Hearing you stop by our Discord community to say “Maxed out the demo on Beastopia. Definitely can't wait ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:37:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034867","verified_at":"2026-10-23T09:04:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4867740-1846018067927947","game_id":"steam-4867740","kind":"announcement","title":"The BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS Demo Is Out Now! 🐾🔥","summary":"Hello, Voyagers!Ahead of Steam Next Fest, we’re thrilled to finally release the BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS demo!Play now and experience scavenging, intense combat, and thrilling extractions.✨ What Is BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS?BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS is a 2D PvPvE animal extraction shooter set in a post-apocalyptic world where humanity has gone extinct.Explore zombie-infested ruins, gather valuable resources, compete against other survivors, and make it out alive. Use everything you recover to develop your own hideo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T01:00:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927947","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4867740-1845383656396433","game_id":"steam-4867740","kind":"announcement","title":"BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS Steam Demo Launches on October 8! 🐾","summary":"Hello, Voyagers!We’re thrilled to announce that the BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS Steam demo will launch on October 8!Get ready to loot, fight, and experience the tension of a daring extraction.🐾 About the BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS DemoBEASTOPIA: RAIDERS tells a brutal tale of survival in a world where humanity has gone extinct and animals have inherited what remains.In the demo, you’ll enter the game’s first map, the City Outskirts Border Zone, where you’ll encounter other players and hostile threats, scavenge v","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T13:26:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396433","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4867740-1845383656395952","game_id":"steam-4867740","kind":"announcement","title":"BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS Is Coming to Steam Next Fest! 🐾🔫","summary":"Hello, Voyagers! 🫡We’re happy to announce that BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS is joining Steam Next Fest!During the event, you’ll get your first chance to enter the world of Beastopia, meet other raiders, gather valuable loot, and make your escape.BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS Steam Next Fest Trailer🌟 More OFFMOON Games at Steam Next FestBEASTOPIA: RAIDERS isn’t the only OFFMOON title joining Steam Next Fest!Visit the OFFMOON Steam Publisher Page to discover our other participating games and check out the latest news:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T10:37:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395952","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4867740-1844751498217838","game_id":"steam-4867740","kind":"announcement","title":"Introducing BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS","summary":"Salute to all Voyagers! 🫡We’re excited to introduce our upcoming title, BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS! 🐾🔫BEASTOPIA: RAIDERS is a 2D PvPvE animal extraction shooter set after humanity’s extinction. Venture into ruined cities and dangerous laboratories, search for valuable supplies, and return safely to your shelter with your loot. The game will also be participating in Steam Next Fest this October, so prepare to enter the ruins and experience your first raid!📅 Planned Release Date: TBA🎮 Wishlist BEASTOPIA: ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T09:14:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217838","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4867740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:02Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:01Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4867740":"2026-10-26T14:53:02Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4867740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:01Z"},"5179220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2